      "sha256": "8907a286be7adb50b40c6e2afa6d3d8c0986ed4fc3730698ea2a7a8c87cd49d9"
    },
    {
      "id": "3396300f83fa7a",
      "file": "page-02-3396300f83fa7a.mp3",
      "text": "A friendly stranger. Under a tall oak tree, a wolf steps onto the path. \"Good morning! Where are you going?\" he asks politely. \"To Grandma's cottage, near the old bridge,\" Little Red replies. \"He seems friendly,\" she thinks. \"I guess he wants to help.\" The wolf points towards some flowers. \"Those would make a lovely present.\" Little Red smiles. She does not notice his hungry eyes.",
      "kind": "section",
      "bytes": 408390,
      "sha256": "938171c9d43a513d6574dd513681fcd65c0775db348cf0527a9ac0a93e20c89a"
    },
